    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "The three venerables know that Spectral Soul once wanted to create killing path, failed after devouring black heaven’s heavenly spirit, and was forced to create soul path instead. Immortal Gu Kill is clearly the core Immortal Gu of killing path, and it was not formed easily. Its refinement was one undergone by the Heavenly Dao. Because it was refined in Spectral Soul Demon Venerable’s body, even though he is not sane, he is quite close to creating killing path. Giant Sun Immortal Venerable says killing path is already showing signs of emerging, and orders the Huang Jin tribe Gu Immortals headed to Central Continent not to get near Spectral Soul Demon Venerable, not to be greedy for super resource points, and to keep away from Heaven Refining Demon Venerable too.",
        "chapters": [
          2328
        ],
